## 3. Anti-Split-Brain Sync Pipeline (DEC-022 Invariant)

When deploying a standalone documentation repository or portal directory (e.g. `DNK-Ecom_OS` alongside `DNK_HUB`):
- **Prohibited Anti-Pattern:** Manual authoring of documentation in an external directory separate from the core codebase. This causes rapid context drift within 7–14 days.
- **Enforced Workflow:**
  1. `DNK_HUB` remains the sole development SSOT for code, models, and architecture specs (`docs/specs/`, `docs/adr/`, `core/`, `apps/api/`).
  2. An automated one-way compiler script (`scripts/export_docs_to_portal.py`) transforms internal markdown and OpenAPI specs into Fumadocs MDX content in the destination portal.
  3. Pre-commit verification (`scripts/verify_all.sh`) ensures zero documentation drift prior to merging releases.
